		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=1180#comment-48044</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Oh, Garuda, now it is my turn to watch friends pass. It comes so quickly. No regrets. We shared a kind Friend, brother.  What GREAT fortune that someone raised us from our denseness when we turned to hear.

You worked in rough leather hides and made beauty your way, knives and scrapers. I loved you.
Gruff like our German Sufi brothers. Sympatico.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Oh, Garuda, now it is my turn to watch friends pass. It comes so quickly. No regrets. We shared a kind Friend, brother.  What GREAT fortune that someone raised us from our denseness when we turned to hear.</p>
<p>You worked in rough leather hides and made beauty your way, knives and scrapers. I loved you.<br />
Gruff like our German Sufi brothers. Sympatico.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
